    {
      "scene": "03-bell",
      "order": 1,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice": "cedar",
      "text": "Their guide led them to Founders' Bell, greened with age and suspended beneath a limestone arch. It had once called students to assembly, she explained. Now it rang at Opening Convocation and commencement, marking the entrance and exit of a McCall-Hart education.",
